<title>RUSSIA: Russian PPI rise slows to 1.8 pct monthly in Sept.</title>
<headline>Russian PPI rise slows to 1.8 pct monthly in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian month-on-month industrial prices rose 1.8 percent in September after a 2.1 percent rise in August, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES   SEPT 96    AUG 96   SEPT 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change	+1.8	+2.1	+5.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	 +31.4     +36.5    +250.3</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
